fail-422  | board | gh/pr-list.json @ patches/add-behind.jq   | STUB_GH_api_repos_teststuffstash_testrepo_pulls_101_update_branch=fail | fail-422 |
# ── #1649: the nudge carries leg 1's merge-ready predicate (it is the third call site of the
# update-branch mutation, and a sibling of leg 1's pick). The two rows below are the pin: on the
# pre-#1649 source (selector = armed ∧ BEHIND alone) BOTH were nudged, so both red on base.
park-noop       | board | gh/pr-list.json @ patches/add-parked-behind.jq     | | noop |
unreviewed-noop | board | gh/pr-list.json @ patches/add-unreviewed-behind.jq | | noop |
# ── ADR-141 (minted in homelab PR#2003 — GitHub Actions majors merge on their own; this carve-out is one of its consequences): an UNTOUCHED Renovate PR on a GROUPED-ACTIONS branch is Renovate's to rebase (the two
# rules with rebaseWhen behind-base-branch); any other Renovate class is still nudged (PR#2004 review) —
# the same predicate as update-pr-branch.sh legs 1+2. Both rows probe commits; on the pre-carve-out
# source the untouched row was nudged (red on base), the worker-pushed one still is.
renovate-untouched-noop      | board | gh/pr-list.json @ patches/add-renovate-behind.jq | | renovate-skip  | n=150 oid=ren150oid789
renovate-worker-pushed-nudge | board | gh/pr-list.json @ patches/add-renovate-behind.jq | | renovate-nudge | n=150 oid=ren150oid789
renovate-other-class-noop    | board | gh/pr-list.json @ patches/add-renovate-other-class.jq | | renovate-skip | n=152 oid=ren152oid789
# ── ADR-153 (2026-10-12): every Renovate branch is Renovate's (the `-other-class` row flipped from a
# nudge to a skip — red on the pre-ADR-153 source), EXCEPT the merge-ready one: untouched + GREEN
# rollup on an armed+APPROVED candidate is nudged (currency is the only gap). Axis = the row's rollup.
renovate-untouched-green-nudge | board | gh/pr-list.json @ patches/add-renovate-behind.jq | | renovate-ready-nudge | n=150 oid=ren150oid789
# Login shape (homelab#2007): the rows carry the REAL `app/homelab-renovate-1234` list shape the raw test missed.
# ── 2026-10-24 (renovate-currency.sh, the shared predicate): the 10-20 zombies were made HERE — this
# nudge (coordinator-git) merged master into homelab#2754 and sleep-tracking#203, the update missed,
# and the next tick's skip left them to a Renovate that had disowned them. `-merged-red-handback`: a
# foreign merge commit + red → tick the rebase box, no PUT (RED on the pre-fix source: a skip line).
# `-superseded-cancel-green-nudge`: #2754's rollup (ci CANCELLED beside ci SUCCESS) is green → nudge
# (RED on the pre-fix source, which read the CANCELLED as red).
renovate-merged-red-handback        | board | gh/pr-list.json @ patches/add-renovate-behind.jq | | renovate-handback | n=150 oid=ren150oid789
renovate-superseded-cancel-green-nudge | board | gh/pr-list.json @ patches/add-renovate-behind.jq | | renovate-ready-nudge | n=150 oid=ren150oid789
